stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Normal
  Normal --> Counting: request or failed login
  Counting --> Normal: window passes (10 s requests / 60 s logins)
  Counting --> Locked: over 20 requests in 10 s (IP)\nor 5 failed logins in 60 s (account)
  Locked --> Locked: requests get 429, not logged again
  Locked --> Normal: 60 s lock ends
  Locked --> Normal: Reset button (POST /api/reset)
  Counting --> Normal: Reset button
